---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import ProvenanceColophon from '../components/ProvenanceColophon.astro';
---

<Layout title="The Ecology & Philosophy">
  <Header />
  <main>
    <section class="page-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">The Ecology & Manifesto</p>
      <h1>Learning does not happen in isolation.</h1>
      <p>Gurudevi is an epistemic sanctuary and education support system for Sri Lanka—grounding software artifacts in pedagogical care, teacher dignity, and decentralized digital sovereignty.</p>
      <div class="pt-6 w-full">
        <ProvenanceColophon
          cadence="perennial"
          author="Gurudevi Epistemic Core"
          publishDate={new Date('2026-08-01')}
          version="Canonical Ecology"
          customNote="Foundational ecology manifesto defining the philosophy of Teaning and sovereign educational spaces."
        />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section prose-section">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">The Concept of Teaning</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Teaning is where teaching and learning meet.</h2>
        <p>We use “teaning” to name the living relationship between the person who teaches, the person who learns, and the conditions around them. Educational technology should make that human relationship easier to inhabit—never harder.</p>
        <p>Gurudevi is neither a corporate LMS nor a surveillance platform. It is a set of connected, local-first spaces calibrated for the real conditions of Sri Lankan schools.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section about-principles">
      <div class="section__heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Core Pedagogical Principles</p>
          <h2>One ecology. Many centers of practice.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Shared reality does not require identical access. Good systems coordinate without violating privacy, agency, or care.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle-list">
        <div>
          <span>01</span>
          <h3>Support Before Extraction</h3>
          <p>Every tool returns more energy and clarity than it takes from educators and learners.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span>02</span>
          <h3>Different Views, Shared Dignity</h3>
          <p>Teachers, students, leaders, and families need distinct workspaces—not different human worth.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span>03</span>
          <h3>Human Review Stays Sovereign</h3>
          <p>Algorithms may organize patterns, but they never replace human judgment, relationship, or consent.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section prose-section">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Epistemic Grounding</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Built on Design Science Research.</h2>
        <p>Gurudevi is developed through the rigorous cadence of Design Science Research (Hevner 3-Cycle framework), linking classroom realities with pedagogical science and open data protocols.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/#roadmap">Explore our multi-year horizon (Alpha 2026 → Beta 2027 → GA 2028) <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
